  "solution": {
    "text": "<math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>N</mtext> <mtext>T</mtext> </msup> <mtext>MN</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mtext>T</mtext> </msup> <mo>=</mo> <msup> <mtext>N</mtext> <mtext>T</mtext> </msup> <msup> <mtext>M</mtext> <mtext>T</mtext> </msup> <mtext>N</mtext> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;is symmetric if M is symmetric and skew-symmetric if M is skew-symmetric.<br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>MN</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>NM</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mtext>T</mtext> </msup> <mo>=</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>MN</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mtext>T</mtext> </msup> <mo>-</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>NM</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mtext>T</mtext> </msup> </mrow> </math><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>NM</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>MN</mtext> </mrow> </math><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>MN</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>NM</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br />skew symmetric<br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>MN</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mtext>T</mtext> </msup> <mo>=</mo> <msup> <mtext>N</mtext> <mtext>T</mtext> </msup> <msup> <mtext>M</mtext> <mtext>T</mtext> </msup> </mrow> </math><br /><math><mrow><mo>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; =&nbsp;</mo> <mtext>NM</mtext> </mrow> </math><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math><mrow><mo> ≠&nbsp;</mo> <mtext>MN</mtext> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;hence not correct<br />Standard result is<br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>adj</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>MN</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>adj N</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>adj M</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>≠</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>adj M</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>adj N</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math>",
